griculture\">Agriculture</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/robotics-ai\">AI &amp; Robotics</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/solar-powered\">Solar Powered</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/tomorrow-initiative\">Tomorrow Initiative</a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/faq\">Frequently Asked Questions</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       HERO — FULL BLEED IMAGE + TEXT\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section id=\"hero\" class=\"hero\">\n\n    <!-- Background: community image full-bleed -->\n    <div class=\"hero-visual\">\n      <!-- PRIMARY HERO IMAGE from win-an-apartment page -->\n      <img\n        class=\"hero-bg-img\"\n        src=\"/free-year1-hero.webp\"\n        alt=\"Elysium waterfront community viewed from a private balcony\"\n        loading=\"eager\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"hero-scrim\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Hero Copy — centred, over image -->\n    <div class=\"hero-copy\">\n      <p class=\"hero-eyebrow\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"0\">Giveaway — Limited Entries</p>\n      <h1 class=\"hero-h1\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"120\">\n        Live Here.<br />For Free.\n      </h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-sub\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"260\">\n        Greenhouse breakfast. Lantern-lit river. Sauna. Cold plunge.<br class=\"br-d\" />\n        Midnight theatres. Seasonal festivals. A hundred acres of nature.&nbsp;Yours.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"hero-actions\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"400\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/living-spaces-v2\" class=\"btn-black\">Enter the Giveaway</a>\n        <a href=\"#what\" class=\"btn-ghost-white\">What is Elysium ↓</a>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Floating value chip -->\n      <div class=\"hero-chip\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"520\">\n        <span class=\"chip-dot\"></span>\n        $36,000 in value · 12 months rent-free\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Floating apartment floor-plan card (from actual win-an-apartment page) -->\n    <div class=\"hero-card\" data-animate=\"slide-up\" data-delay=\"300\">\n      <div class=\"hero-card-tag\">The Prize</div>\n      <img\n        src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=o9jgRY5lJo3FiRB1DUUwWsvEB1Xsch%2BM%2Bqj4nQJAbX4TKGbrMPioDbxS%2BPsVFt%2BoJS4U%2FBiwsZe5dUlKZKjaoJGn6gp0XGW9J%2BbFSaVFHXwdEnnI%2FxyWbmq2ZAYrbgvj%2FK6c8J6j5RuqX%2FLK2zmb1UXscVWjZ%2BT9vZwT05A%3D&u2=kcm%2BkDtwQkBaBIp1&width=2560\"\n        alt=\"Elysium apartment floor plan — isometric view\"\n        class=\"hero-card-img\"\n        loading=\"eager\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"hero-card-label\">\n        <strong>1-Bedroom Community Unit</strong>\n        <span>Fully furnished · All amenities included</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Scroll cue -->\n    <div class=\"hero-scroll\" data-animate=\"fade-in\" data-delay=\"700\">\n      <div class=\"scroll-dot\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       INTRO CARD (the white card from their site)\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section id=\"what\" class=\"intro-section\">\n    <div class=\"intro-card\">\n      <p class=\"intro-eyebrow\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">The Vision</p>\n      <h2 class=\"intro-h2\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n        Traditional Property Isn't<br class=\"br-d\" /> Worth It Anymore.<br />\n        Experiential Real Estate<br class=\"br-d\" /> Is The Future.\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"intro-body\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"200\">\n        Elysium creates experiential microcities — sustainable communities with organic farms, green energy, complimentary transportation, and services built around human well-being. Through new construction technology, a community-driven economy, and automated operations, we make ridiculously affordable living possible.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Three pillars -->\n      <div class=\"pillars\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"300\">\n        <div class=\"pillar\">\n          <div class=\"pillar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <path d=\"M8 32L20 8L32 32\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n              <path d=\"M12 24H28\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#1a1a1a\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Organic Farms</h3>\n          <p>Farm-to-table food grown steps from your door. Seasonal harvests, morning markets, zero food miles.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pillar-divider\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pillar\">\n          <div class=\"pillar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <rect x=\"7\" y=\"7\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"4\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n              <path d=\"M14 20H26M20 14V26\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Green Energy</h3>\n          <p>Net-zero community infrastructure. Solar, geothermal, and smart grid systems power everything you use.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pillar-divider\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pillar\">\n          <div class=\"pillar-icon\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"13\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"5\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n              <path d=\"M20 7V13M20 27V33M7 20H13M27 20H33\" stroke=\"#1a1a1a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3>Human Well-Being</h3>\n          <p>Designed for your nervous system. Sauna. Cold plunge. Meditation gardens. A life built around flourishing.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       LIFE INSIDE — VISUAL SCROLL STRIP\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"life-section\">\n    <div class=\"life-header container-pad\">\n      <p class=\"section-eyebrow\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">Life Inside Elysium</p>\n      <h2 class=\"section-h2\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"100\">\n        A hundred acres of nature.<br />Yours.\n      </h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Horizontal image scroll -->\n    <div class=\"life-gallery-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"life-gallery\" id=\"lifeGallery\">\n\n        <figure class=\"life-fig life-fig--tall\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=qUaIwvTnZFaa2Y33S6Clz7QVa6NNobumEFzhh8k8povbLp%2BvA%2Bh78b8EnuQELmOBSHBf7xnVU7piGgvryNGkTCdQ5kIXrYERCsNCFWwuh0p4GO%2Fe9z9TwIHJJEonvSc%2BuKYIf%2B%2FA5TFQH4%2FvZeyuWpwq1VMtROVaOAYGV76%2FwsdpBSWVaRrdBzapzy7H0RVYOZfk%2Fi%2FIz8KxHR7nLVRDHg%3D%3D&u2=%2BXfVnDEl90ZU%2Fb%2FD&width=2560\"\n            alt=\"Organic outdoor lounge under wooden canopy with community members\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n          <figcaption>Nature-First Cowork</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n\n        <figure class=\"life-fig life-fig--wide\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=hBOrJTuwZzZaUuAyLnFUkWfu0oGyPcBnlzRIluQ6luRVpmhhcuIoDjMPu5ViJ3CmpnKVKCaxuh9JElMZfw2wBLeDZppUCLJTZzmpZb5tZdarxVZvMg2ycBMlBnFr9K7VD%2BKX%2FP9CoZBOyQMt3SZpIRV0u0FpL7c1Mx2cLHXG9Wd6%2Bu48Pw%3D%3D&u2=X02TIXmzm7SozI9J&width=2560\"\n            alt=\"Vibrant food hall market inside Elysium community\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n          <figcaption>The Culinary Quarter</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n\n        <figure class=\"life-fig life-fig--tall\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=ILZht1EjC%2Bv6RtDHrB%2BrXuGuB%2BYryYZ61aVLDLNPdvi7DzszNuETPW8oLkAjkkctI69zvpqbLAr%2BOCYwTleDpz3nKoEU6XdDaTWzAB1sO4TGLcxLHvNAIspCqig9GqAXa16GPfh60Lx8iepb9uBdrnFqy8ryfjiK1werkpWqv%2FnqolD5jCoYS3gdyy7kdnwyl34iR4PZSw%3D%3D&u2=dHukFdA1DGt2eboo&width=2560\"\n            alt=\"Biophilic wellness gym with living walls and natural wood\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n          <figcaption>Biophilic Fitness</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n\n        <figure class=\"life-fig life-fig--wide\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=c9CRXKc1eKAkXuziOmt%2FmKOyolWFjLtaNBk0xAV%2F8dMSQLecY2xwnnph2Ufk6GTMIK5yKNiQ%2BkgZ7iUchihrSPjKb9P%2BfA7z0HtpMeRQD4Ws8BVMK2Hbb7KUE7vceGGYRHLCVXJFclqrzkQNXcii0Lo3OgWlhdWnChycW6Vrf1GfJy0BA6LpoXOVkA%3D%3D&u2=Vly1s1DlkP1wcfDt&width=2560\"\n            alt=\"Community summer festival with BBQ and live music\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n          <figcaption>Seasonal Festivals</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n\n        <figure class=\"life-fig life-fig--tall\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=Ndyi4NRO%2BS%2FYEAfY4vOjc%2Bl1tZib9inl5e6qSWbjnX%2Faa5A4HeLYtJfgPHi7ykXrwP%2BJoay2zSFcsAHW9BKiR2%2B9DdrKW%2BZcI6y5E34MRc%2FhK7vKhIvLF%2BC05MOJPSkejNr%2B%2FkRYr8GtJSBBTyvTln5NVPtxb7lHtRUIT1g6UwA7JL3OdXsxUbP%2BDLRhp8JsCKw9LtOXkJD5xrH87i3SPMOxtvsgQ%2FpbLzx882SmASm4xC1CKK4LwNZ3CiywckyrOqRzlO4%3D&u2=UnuFvrt%2FQelaOKzY&width=2560\"\n            alt=\"Luxury canal waterfront with dining promenade\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n          <figcaption>Lantern-Lit River</figcaption>\n        </figure>\n\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"gallery-fade-r\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       MANIFESTO — FULL BLEED QUOTE\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"manifesto\">\n    <div class=\"manifesto-bg-wrap\">\n      <img\n        src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=UGHZNgSGZjBlJNtWjbkx%2FjFRfFaSHjiX0kKqXh%2Bw3gmiYq3yzLVhFnjPCbGe1dofp8DG6vP11P7IQkxlqRGs1LE1fdj8mcDnFz2CMCexiDBp4WV1Lop63TQh7eUIUBjkrjaRGBVuNDHXrUpJ%2BwJ%2Fxp5tvzEGAnGPBmXY1HgdnF9q0oSAF1ooZHWdgSdJJrPLOxjX2UAlLhs0mX00PseA%2BWY790bpjVt0XJq9xd%2FKNJS96rj9Tw%3D%3D&u2=c8GrhxV6WXLU4AmQ\"\n        alt=\"Elysium community evening\"\n        class=\"manifesto-bg-img\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n      <div class=\"manifesto-scrim\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"manifesto-inner\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">\n      <blockquote>\n        \"Your environment is your destiny.<br class=\"br-d\" /> We're building one worth living in.\"\n      </blockquote>\n      <cite>— Elysium Communities · Experiential Microcities &amp; Wellness · Est. 2030</cite>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       PRIZE DETAILS — WHITE CARD\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"prize-section\">\n    <div class=\"prize-card\">\n      <div class=\"prize-card-left\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow dark\">The Prize</p>\n        <h2 class=\"prize-h2\">\n          Twelve months.<br />Rent-free.<br />All in.\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"prize-body\">\n          One winner receives a full year of complimentary residency in an Elysium community unit — furnished, amenity-inclusive, and designed for a life you actually want to live.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"prize-value-pill\">\n          <span class=\"prize-num\" id=\"prizeCounter\">$0K</span>\n          <span class=\"prize-val-label\">Total Value</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"prize-card-right\" data-animate=\"scale-in\" data-delay=\"150\">\n        <ul class=\"prize-list\">\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"prize-check\">✓</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong>12 Months Rent-Free</strong>\n              <p>No lease. No payments. Just live.</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"prize-check\">✓</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Fully Furnished Unit</strong>\n              <p>Move in with nothing but yourself.</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"prize-check\">✓</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Full Amenity Access</strong>\n              <p>Every gym, pool, spa, farm, coworking space — yours.</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"prize-check\">✓</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Complimentary Transport</strong>\n              <p>Electric mobility within the community, included.</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n          <li>\n            <span class=\"prize-check\">✓</span>\n            <div>\n              <strong>Founding Resident Status</strong>\n              <p>Shape the culture of Elysium from day one.</p>\n            </div>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n        <!-- Apartment image as proof of prize -->\n        <div class=\"prize-apt-img-wrap\">\n          <img\n            src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=o9jgRY5lJo3FiRB1DUUwWsvEB1Xsch%2BM%2Bqj4nQJAbX4TKGbrMPioDbxS%2BPsVFt%2BoJS4U%2FBiwsZe5dUlKZKjaoJGn6gp0XGW9J%2BbFSaVFHXwdEnnI%2FxyWbmq2ZAYrbgvj%2FK6c8J6j5RuqX%2FLK2zmb1UXscVWjZ%2BT9vZwT05A%3D&u2=kcm%2BkDtwQkBaBIp1&width=2560\"\n            alt=\"Apartment floor plan isometric view\"\n            class=\"prize-apt-img\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n          <p class=\"prize-apt-caption\">1-Bed · Open Plan · Private Balcony</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       HOW IT WORKS\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"how-section\">\n    <div class=\"how-inner container-pad\">\n      <p class=\"section-eyebrow dark\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">How It Works</p>\n      <h2 class=\"section-h2 dark\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"80\">Three steps to a new life.</h2>\n      <div class=\"how-steps\">\n        <div class=\"how-step\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"step-n\">01</div>\n          <h3>Enter</h3>\n          <p>Fill in the form. Name, email, and one sentence about what Elysium means to you.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"how-step-arrow\">→</div>\n        <div class=\"how-step\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"120\">\n          <div class=\"step-n\">02</div>\n          <h3>Share</h3>\n          <p>Each share earns bonus entries. Spread the vision. Increase your odds.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"how-step-arrow\">→</div>\n        <div class=\"how-step\" data-animate=\"fade-up\" data-delay=\"240\">\n          <div class=\"step-n\">03</div>\n          <h3>Win</h3>\n          <p>One winner. One year. Free rent in an Elysium community. Announced live on our socials.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       TESTIMONIAL — PERSON PHOTO\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"testimonial-section\">\n    <div class=\"testimonial-card\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">\n      <div class=\"testimonial-img-col\">\n        <img\n          src=\"https://sspark.genspark.ai/cfimages?u1=5hcZaPhaU16NoZJD98WEcg5lD%2FHNiMQZgbfI3DuN%2B%2BcegdKe9BOc1WoMDsd6YC7tgCmC468U2J7dSuZOfY5VJV18nXgWm4tzIj15d%2BRrn%2BrsH0PorUokfJXhizbpuRa5CZ7MYa05vviChuhM4ov60Ne%2BJo9%2FjUGKPgZislf7MOupsqed57DHN9BicYLUtUeHtdIYS69DP6OV&u2=qdoaVxcrBTvb8wYM&width=2560\"\n          alt=\"Elysium resident\"\n          class=\"testimonial-photo\"\n          loading=\"lazy\"\n        />\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"testimonial-text-col\">\n        <div class=\"testimonial-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <blockquote class=\"testimonial-q\">\n          \"I've lived in luxury buildings in three cities. None of them changed me. Elysium did. I sleep better, think clearer, and feel more connected — to myself and to people who actually care about the world.\"\n        </blockquote>\n        <cite class=\"testimonial-attr\">— Elysium Phase I Resident</cite>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       ENTRY FORM\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section id=\"enter\" class=\"form-section\">\n    <div class=\"form-section-inner container-pad\">\n      <!-- Left: Pitch -->\n      <div class=\"form-pitch\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">\n        <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Enter to Win</p>\n        <h2 class=\"form-pitch-h2\">\n          Your future<br />is one entry<br />away.\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"form-pitch-body\">\n          The life you've been imagining — conscious, connected, extraordinary — is being built right now. Enter. Live differently.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"form-trust-list\">\n          <div class=\"trust-row\"><span class=\"trust-check\">✓</span> No purchase necessary</div>\n          <div class=\"trust-row\"><span class=\"trust-check\">✓</span> Open to US residents 18+</div>\n          <div class=\"trust-row\"><span class=\"trust-check\">✓</span> Your info is never sold or shared</div>\n          <div class=\"trust-row\"><span class=\"trust-check\">✓</span> Winner announced publicly on socials</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right: Form card -->\n      <div class=\"form-card\" data-animate=\"scale-in\" data-delay=\"150\">\n        <form id=\"entryForm\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"fg-row\">\n            <div class=\"fg\">\n              <label for=\"firstName\">First Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"firstName\" name=\"firstName\" placeholder=\"First name\" required autocomplete=\"given-name\" />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fg\">\n              <label for=\"lastName\">Last Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"lastName\" name=\"lastName\" placeholder=\"Last name\" required autocomplete=\"family-name\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fg\">\n            <label for=\"email\">Email Address</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required autocomplete=\"email\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fg\">\n            <label for=\"instagram\">Instagram Handle <span class=\"fg-opt\">(bonus entries)</span></label>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"instagram\" name=\"instagram\" placeholder=\"@yourhandle\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fg\">\n            <label for=\"why\">In one sentence — what does living in Elysium mean to you?</label>\n            <textarea id=\"why\" name=\"why\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"It means waking up in a place that actually reflects who I'm becoming…\" required></textarea>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fg fg-check\">\n            <label class=\"check-label\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"consent\" name=\"consent\" required />\n              <span class=\"check-box\"></span>\n              <span class=\"check-text\">I agree to the <a href=\"#terms\" class=\"form-a\">Official Rules</a> and understand I may receive Elysium updates. Unsubscribe any time.</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-submit\" id=\"submitBtn\">\n            <span class=\"btn-txt\">Enter the Giveaway</span>\n            <span class=\"btn-arr\">→</span>\n          </button>\n        </form>\n\n        <!-- Success state -->\n        <div id=\"successMsg\" class=\"success-state\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          <div class=\"success-icon\">✦</div>\n          <h3>You're in.</h3>\n          <p>Watch your inbox — and keep an eye on our socials for the announcement.</p>\n          <div class=\"share-block\">\n            <p class=\"share-label\">Increase your odds — share:</p>\n            <div class=\"share-btns\">\n              <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=I+just+entered+to+win+a+FREE+year+in+an+%40ElysiumOnX+community.+Enter+here%3A+elysiumcommunities.com%2Fwin-an-apartment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"share-x\">Share on X</a>\n              <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/elysiumcommunities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"share-ig\">Follow on Instagram</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       FINAL CTA — DARK\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <section class=\"final-cta\">\n    <div class=\"final-cta-inner container-pad\" data-animate=\"fade-up\">\n      <p class=\"section-eyebrow light\">Coming 2030</p>\n      <h2 class=\"final-h2\">This is the door.<br />Are you walking through?</h2>\n      <p class=\"final-sub\">The giveaway closes when the community opens. Don't wait.</p>\n      <a href=\"#enter\" class=\"btn-white\">Enter Now — It's Free</a>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════\n       FOOTER\n  ══════════════════════════════════════ -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-inner container-pad\">\n      <div class=\"footer-top\">\n        <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n          <span class=\"footer-logo\">ELYSIUM</span>\n          <span class=\"footer-tagline\">Experiential Microcities &amp; Wellness</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"footer-nav\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com\" class=\"footer-link\">Communities</a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/contact-us\" class=\"footer-link\">Contact</a>\n          <a href=\"https://x.com/ElysiumOnX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"footer-link\">@ElysiumOnX</a>\n          <a href=\"#terms\" class=\"footer-link\">Official Rules</a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"terms\" class=\"footer-legal\">\n        <p><strong>Official Rules (Summary):</strong> No purchase necessary. Open to legal residents of the United States, 18 years of age or older. Void where prohibited. Sweepstakes begins upon page launch and ends when the community opens for residency or at the discretion of the Sponsor. One (1) Grand Prize winner will receive complimentary residency for twelve (12) months in an Elysium community unit (approximate retail value: $36,000 USD). Winner selected by random drawing from all valid entries received. Odds of winning depend on number of valid entries. Sponsor: Elysium Communities. Winner will be notified via email and announced on official Elysium social media channels. All entries become property of Elysium Communities. Elysium Communities reserves the right to cancel, modify, or suspend this sweepstakes at any time for any reason. For full rules, contact: <a href=\"https://www.elysiumcommunities.com/contact-us\" class=\"footer-link-inline\">elysiumcommunities.com/contact-us</a>.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-copy\">\n        © 2025 Elysium Communities. All rights reserved. Building the world we actually want to live in.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n\n\n\n\n"
